**SAT Collision Helper** (`/Users/rodrigooliveira/git/roo-oliv/monodreams/MonoDreams/Extensions/Monogame/SATCollision.cs`):
```csharp
public static bool PolygonVsPolygon(
    ReadOnlySpan<Vector2> polyA,
    ReadOnlySpan<Vector2> polyB,
    out Vector2 normal,
    out float depth)
```
- Also has `ComputeAABB(Vector2[] vertices)` for broad-phase
- And `PolygonCenter(ReadOnlySpan<Vector2> polygon)` helper

### 3. RENDERING PIPELINE & DRAW COMPONENTS

**DrawComponent** (`/Users/rodrigooliveira/git/roo-oliv/monodreams/MonoDreams/Component/Draw/DrawComponent.cs`):
```csharp
public class DrawComponent
{
    public DrawElementType Type;
    public RenderTargetID Target;

    // Transform fields
    public Vector2 Position;
    public float Rotation;
    public Vector2 Origin;
    public Vector2 Scale = Vector2.One;
    public Color Color = Color.White;
    public float LayerDepth;

    // Sprite-specific
    public Texture2D? Texture;
    public Rectangle? SourceRectangle;
    public Vector2 Size;

    // Mesh-specific (IMPORTANT FOR DEBUG DRAWING)
    public VertexPositionColor[]? Vertices;
    public int[]? Indices;
    public PrimitiveType PrimitiveType = PrimitiveType.TriangleList;
    public Matrix? WorldMatrix;  // For mesh transform
}
```

**DrawElementType enum** (`/Users/rodrigooliveira/git/roo-oliv/monodreams/MonoDreams/Component/Draw/DrawElementType.cs`):
